{
  "name": "TLG 03 — QC Approve/Reject Webhook",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## TLG QC Webhook\nDrive me still/clip dekhne ke baad browser se ek URL kholo:\n\n```\nhttps://YOUR-N8N/webhook/tlg-qc?clip_id=S01-1A&verdict=approve\nhttps://YOUR-N8N/webhook/tlg-qc?clip_id=S01-1A&verdict=reject&notes=bloom%20wrong\n```\n\n- `approve` → sheet me status **APPROVED**\n- `reject` → status **REJECTED** (wapas TODO karna ho toh sheet me edit karo)\n\n**Zaroori:** workflow ko **Activate** karna padega tabhi production webhook URL chalega. `Update QC Row` node me Sheet ID Config node (TLG 01 wali values) yahan `QC Config` me paste karo.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 480
      },
      "id": "d0c3d4e5-0001-4c01-9c01-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky — QC Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-620, 20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "GET",
        "path": "tlg-qc",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d0c3d4e5-0002-4c02-9c02-000000000002",
      "name": "QC Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-540, 400],
      "webhookId": "d0c3d4e5-aaaa-4c02-9c02-000000000002"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "qc-sheet-doc",
              "name": "sheetDocId",
              "value": "PASTE_GOOGLE_SHEET_ID_HERE",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "qc-sheet-tab",
              "name": "sheetTab",
              "value": "Render Tracker",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d0c3d4e5-0003-4c03-9c03-000000000003",
      "name": "QC Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [-320, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const q = $input.first().json.query || {};\nconst clipId = String(q.clip_id || '').trim();\nconst v = String(q.verdict || '').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst status = (v === 'approve' || v === 'approved') ? 'APPROVED'\n  : (v === 'reject' || v === 'rejected') ? 'REJECTED'\n  : '';\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    clipId,\n    status,\n    notes: String(q.notes || '').trim(),\n    verdictRaw: v,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "d0c3d4e5-0004-4c04-9c04-000000000004",
      "name": "Read QC Params",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-100, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "qc-clipid",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.clipId }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "qc-status",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.status }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d0c3d4e5-0005-4c05-9c05-000000000005",
      "name": "Valid QC?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [120, 400]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "update",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "={{ $('QC Config').first().json.sheetDocId }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('QC Config').first().json.sheetTab }}"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "status": "={{ $json.status }}",
            "qc_notes": "={{ 'QC: ' + ($json.notes || 'approved via webhook') }}"
          }
        },
        "lookupColumn": "clip_id",
        "lookupValue": "={{ $json.clipId }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d0c3d4e5-0006-4c06-9c06-000000000006",
      "name": "Update QC Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.6,
      "position": [360, 300],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "=✅ QC recorded — {{ $('Read QC Params').first().json.clipId }} → {{ $('Read QC Params').first().json.status }}"
      },
      "id": "d0c3d4e5-0007-4c07-9c07-000000000007",
      "name": "Respond OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [580, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "Galat request. Sahi format: /webhook/tlg-qc?clip_id=S01-1A&verdict=approve&notes=optional%20note",
        "responseCode": 400
      },
      "id": "d0c3d4e5-0008-4c08-9c08-000000000008",
      "name": "Respond Bad",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [360, 520]
    }
  ],
